    <string name="privacy_note">RemoHop talks only to the hosts you connect to and the rendezvous server you set here. Everything it stores (identity, pairings, settings) stays in this app\'s private storage. The app runs a local gateway on 127.0.0.1 that only the page with its random per-launch token can use.</string>
